  "I leave the water to graze mainly on grass.": "Dejo el agua para pastar principalmente hierba.",
  "I listen for small animals before making a quick pounce.": "Escucho si hay animales pequeños antes de dar un salto rápido.",
  "I live along cool southern coasts and islands.": "Vivo en las frescas costas e islas del sur.",
  "I live in African grasslands and open woodland.": "Vivo en pastizales africanos y bosques abiertos.",
  "I live in African grasslands and savannas.": "Vivo en pastizales y sabanas africanas.",
