  "Shape enemy routes and command animal soldiers and WeightPlay heroes through 30 stages, six regions, and six distinct Boss battles.": "Da forma a las rutas enemigas y dirige animales soldados y héroes WeightPlay a través de 30 etapas, seis regiones y seis batallas contra jefes distintas.",
