  "Spark Paw Fox": "Zorro Pata Chispa",
  "Spark Paw Fox carries replacement stars through every route. Zebra Pathfinder, Rhino Trailkeeper, Hippo Waterwarden, Eagle Skykeeper, Lion Pridekeeper, and Elephant Crownkeeper each test one five-route region before reopening it. Clearing Route 30 reconnects all six regions.": "Spark Paw Fox lleva estrellas de reemplazo a través de todas las rutas. Zebra Pathfinder, Rhino Trailkeeper, Hippo Waterwarden, Eagle Skykeeper, Lion Pridekeeper y Elephant Crownkeeper prueban cada uno una región de cinco rutas antes de reabrirla. Al superar la Ruta 30 se vuelven a conectar las seis regiones.",
