  "Stage {stage}, Wave {round}/5, Hearts {hearts}/4, Supplies {supplies}. Leaving loses this run's temporary squad, relic, and unsettled progress; permanent training and unlocked stages stay safe.": "Etapa {stage}, Ola {round}/5, Corazones {hearts}/4, Suministros {supplies}. Al salir se pierde el escuadrón temporal, la reliquia y el progreso inestable de esta carrera; El entrenamiento permanente y las etapas desbloqueadas se mantienen seguros.",
  "Stage {stage}/{stageCount}. Time {time}. Golden keys {keys}/{target}. HP {hp}/{maxHp}. Level {level}. Move with WASD or arrow keys, or click, tap, and drag. The ranger automatically attacks the nearest enemy in range. Stage rule: {rule}": "Etapa {stage}/{stageCount}. Hora {time}. Llaves doradas {keys}/{target}. HP {hp}/{maxHp}. Nivel {level}. Muévase con WASD o las teclas de flecha, o haga clic, toque y arrastre. El guardabosques ataca automáticamente al enemigo más cercano dentro del alcance. Regla del escenario: {rule}",
